heading towards Flamengo.</i>

131
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:58,789
<i>Pamphlets were left at the scene</i>

132
00:08:58,872 --> 00:09:01,750
<i>signed by the kidnappers,</i>

133
00:09:01,834 --> 00:09:05,045
