Taking Helena home,
there was a military roadblock.

143
00:09:24,773 --> 00:09:27,776
They were really aggressive,
frisking everyone.

144
00:09:28,402 --> 00:09:29,403
It was awful.

145
00:09:29,486 --> 00:09:31,071
