Veroca!

159
00:10:01,393 --> 00:10:03,562
Dad named him Pimpão.

160
00:10:03,645 --> 00:10:05,147
Don't tell him.

161
00:10:05,230 --> 00:10:08,275
Is he gone? He said
I could ride in the Dodge.

162
00:10:08,358 --> 00:10:09,818
-Some other day...
-RUBENS: Hey, kid!

163
00:10:09,902 --> 00:10:13,071
