-[BABIU EXCLAIMS]

175
00:10:41,892 --> 00:10:44,269
How many prisoners
did they ask for now?

176
00:10:44,811 --> 00:10:47,397
-I don't know.
-Everyone to bed. Now.

177
00:10:47,481 --> 00:10:48,732
I wanna finish watching
the news.

178
00:10:48,815 --> 00:10:50,234
No. Bedtime.

179
